  "html": "<h1 id=\"webflux-web-security\">Web Security</h1>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p><span class=\"small\"><a href=\"web/webmvc/mvc-security.html\">See equivalent in the Servlet stack</a></span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">\n<p>The <a href=\"https://spring.io/projects/spring-security\">Spring Security</a> project provides support\nfor protecting web applications from malicious exploits. See the Spring Security\nreference documentation, including:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ulist\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/reactive/configuration/webflux.html\">WebFlux Security</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/reactive/test/index.html\">WebFlux Testing Support</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/features/exploits/csrf.html#csrf-protection\">CSRF protection</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/features/exploits/headers.html\">Security Response Headers</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n"
